&lt;div class="pageinfo pageinfo-primary"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your interest in contributing to Texera! This guide explains how to contribute to both &lt;strong&gt;Texera’s codebase&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;documentation&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;
We follow a fork-based workflow and adopt the &lt;a href="https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/"&gt;Conventional Commits&lt;/a&gt; standard for commit messages.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>